{"ID":"20240314091832-kw6hwwp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091832-kw6hwwp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091832-kw6hwwp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170511-eo0m5uu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170511-9bzmkf4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:656,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170511-9bzmkf4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:23,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:23\u0026#125;","title":"【甘草粉蜜汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170511-eo0m5uu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-eo0m5uu","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：病腹痛有虫，其脉何以别之？师曰：腹中痛，其脉当沉，若弦，反洪大，故有蛔虫。蛔虫之为病，令人吐涎，心痛，发作有时，毒药不止，甘草粉蜜汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-cos62z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-cos62z2","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草粉蜜汤方："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-cc2cm3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-cc2cm3h","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二两、白粉二两即铅粉、蜜四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-jfqwxuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-jfqwxuq","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上三味，以水三升，先煮甘草，取二升，去滓，内粉蜜，搅令和，煮如薄粥，温服一升，差即止。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-npak8qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-npak8qa","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，大家看这个虫...蛔虫啊，蛲虫啊，肚子里面有寄生虫，这个条辩提供了判断的方法，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如何知道病人有虫？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诊断的方式哦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有人肚子痛，有虫，你从脉上面如何看？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是第一个他的发问呐。张仲景就说啦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个肚子里面痛，脉应该是沉若弦，因为在里面嘛，病在里面，对不对？沉是不是病在里，弦是比较寒。结果这个脉反而洪大，所以我们就可以知道有蚘虫，蛔虫在身上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以虫的脉呢，脉是大的，肚子痛，脉大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-n67w1i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-n67w1i8","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般的你作小建中汤症或者怎么样，那脉都很小，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蚘虫之为病"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"令人吐涎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，嘴巴呢吐口水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是胃痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发作有时，毒药不止者，甘草粉蜜汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-egof3ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-egof3ga","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个甘草粉蜜汤是比乌梅丸更上一层，在经方里面呢，最强的打虫药，就是现在介绍的，甘草粉蜜汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个虫在肚子里面，过去呢我们有很多像用锡粉，用雷丸，还有些使君子，这些都是打虫的药。那我们经方在伤寒论我们介绍有乌梅丸，那个蚘虫从嘴巴里面吐出来，吐虫，我都看过哦，病人吐出来白白一条，一条小小的，就一吐就是虫出来，你看到很恶心啦。他跟我说吐虫还怎么办，对不对？那你还要假装的不动声色，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-fp8fjww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-fp8fjww","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当医生呐，有两个重点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你的手伸出去...所以你们在我诊所临床的时候，我每天早上检查你们的手，手指甲一定要干干净净呐，你手指甲出来是黑的，摸病人的脉，病人一看你的手指甲都是黑的，心已经凉了一半，对不对？所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手一定要干净"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是重点。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-o519ik7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-o519ik7","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个就是要安静"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，静如处子，不动声色，不管他怎么样子脑筋要清楚，不要慌，病人慌你也跟着慌，病人要紧张你也跟着紧张，哦，这个都不对的，哦，这个是经验不够。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-vucduwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-vucduwh","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个甘草粉蜜汤，一定要配合的方子，甘草二，白粉就是铅粉，还有白蜜。这个白粉呢，有两派，日本的很多经方家，日本的经方家像这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大冢敬节"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个好几位啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"东洞吉益"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有人说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吉益东洞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我日本话我不会讲，所以呢，是吉益东洞，还是东洞吉益，我搞不清楚。那这些经方家呢，他们认为说，这个白粉是米粉。米粉打虫我都不相信，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他为什么说吃下去肚子不痛？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很简单呐，那个虫你想想看，你用使君子、用雷丸、用锡粉，那种打都打不出来。那你这个吃下去，虫肚子饿啊，对不对？你一喂下去，它看到米粉，太好啦，它一吃完，它就睡觉去了，当然你那一味下去就不痛啦，对不对？实际上虫还在里面，并没有出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-ur94rii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-ur94rii","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240412140421-ts31y6i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-8nn8mqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-8nn8mqg","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后来我们去研究啊，去研究查了很多过去的一些经验。这个白粉呢就是我们所谓的铅粉。铅粉怎么来呢？是由烧水银...水银啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拿个杯子装着水银，水银呢放在盆子里面这样，火在下面烧，烧完以后气化上来，烧干了以后，水银会有一层粉粘在这个盆上，盆打开来以后，杯子里面的残渣不要用，只用盆上面的粉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个就是这里讲的白粉，颜色这就是白的，这个有毒啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你如果说不加白蜜，我们要设计一个药打虫，我们的目的是希望虫吃到毒药人没有吃到，对不对？你如果不加白蜜，光是甘草，因为甘草煮完就是甜的水嘛，那你配上那个粉煮好以后吃下去，那肯定那个虫很聪明呐，虫吃到甘草，那你吃到是白粉，对不对？所以为了让虫没有选择，蜂蜜加进去，因为蜂蜜很粘稠，让它跟其它药混在一起时候变成稀饭，你没有办法分开来，所以虫就会去吃。虫一吃一咬一定会吃到白粉，目的在这里，所以会有白蜜。好，所以这个名称叫做甘草粉蜜汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-j315a2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-j315a2j","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你如果没有买不到真蜂蜜，不要煮哦！你说老师蜂蜜不重要，不行，就非要蜂蜜不可！不然你的病人吃到白粉，铅粉，结果病人死掉了，虫还活着哦，因为很毒嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-kf43vp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-kf43vp7","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮法呢，你可以先....以水三升先煮甘草，三碗煮两碗，然后把甘草丢掉，再放粉蜜搅和，对不对？然后煮如薄粥，这样你吃的时候，那个虫就没有办法把那个蜜跟那个粉分开来，哦，所以这个一吃虫死掉哦。像你乌梅丸吃下去以后，排出来的活的哦，因为那个虫是逃走的嘛，不是死掉排出来的啊，是逃走的，那个乌梅丸又苦又辣，这个味道又辛，对不对？所以说那个虫闻到了乌梅丸跟着就是那个举家搬迁了，根本是逃出来的啊，所以它虫卵什么统统带出来了，嚯，这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170511-9bzmkf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170511-9bzmkf4","updated":"20240422170511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果乌梅丸没有效，大家就要想到甘草粉蜜汤，好。"}]}]}